EXPLANATION = {"title": "Voxel Occupancy", "principle": "Structures show an average of at least 2.0 occupied grid voxels per residue.", "rationale": "WP-8: rewritten from the incorrect deterministic no-overlap (Pauli exclusion) description. The pinned LAW-155 measures a heuristic voxel-occupancy score (threshold 2.0 V on the atomic grid); it does not measure interatomic overlap (that is LAW-130 Clashscore)."}
